That the brief facts of the case are that the complainant moved application no.PGD no.331408 dated 09-04-2024 against petitioner Paramjit Kaur,
Harmanpreet Singh, Manpreet Singh, Sukhwinder Kaur and Amritpal Singh to the effect that;
(i) Complainant Harminder Singh and his brother Jaspal Singh had purchased a joint plot, which Harminder sold for Rs. 36,00,000/-.
